  "title": "Will is the field’s output on motor neurons",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "260f91e7-b3bc-4281-8c49-3ac81b5f3192",
      "text": "The brain's field influences neural firing through voltage-gated ion channels in a feedback loop, and that influence on the neurons that drive voluntary action is what is called free will. It is not free in the sense of acausal: it is a causal influence consistent with determinism.",
